@if($calculationPreview)
@if($calculationPreview['hasConflict'])<div class="warning"><strong>Preisabweichung gefunden.</strong> Das Alttool würde den Auftrag bei einem bereits berechneten Termin mit geändertem Preis abbrechen.</div>@endif
<div class="subtitle" style="margin-bottom:8px">Berechnungsvorschau · Festpreis, Staffel und Linearstaffel · rein lesend</div>
@forelse($calculationPreview['rows'] as $row)
<div class="calc-row"><div class="pos-title">#{{ $row->position->intID }} · {{ $row->position->strBeschreibung }}</div>
<div style="margin-top:6px"><span class="status {{ $row->status }}">{{ $row->statusLabel }}</span>@if($row->calculationDate)<span class="subtitle" style="margin-left:8px">Berechnungstermin {{ $row->calculationDate->format('d.m.Y') }} · {{ $row->dimension }} / {{ $row->interval }}</span>@endif</div>
@if($row->net !== null)<div class="calc-grid"><div><strong>Menge / Nutzung</strong>{{ $row->quantityLabel ?? number_format($row->quantity,2,',','.') }}</div><div><strong>Einzel-/Staffelpreis</strong>{{ $row->unitPrice !== null ? number_format($row->unitPrice,2,',','.').' €' : '–' }}</div><div><strong>Basis netto</strong>{{ number_format($row->baseNet,2,',','.') }} €</div><div><strong>Rabatt</strong>{{ number_format($row->discountPercent,2,',','.') }} % / {{ number_format($row->discount,2,',','.') }} €</div><div><strong>Netto nach Rabatt</strong>{{ number_format($row->net,2,',','.') }} €</div><div><strong>USt.</strong>{{ number_format($row->taxRate,2,',','.') }} % / {{ number_format($row->tax,2,',','.') }} €</div>@if($row->existingAmount !== null)<div><strong>Bereits gespeichert</strong>{{ number_format($row->existingAmount,2,',','.') }} €</div>@endif</div>@endif
</div>
@empty<div class="empty">Keine Positionen vorhanden.</div>@endforelse
<div class="totals"><div class="total-line"><span>Netto, neu abzurechnen</span><strong>{{ number_format($calculationPreview['net'],2,',','.') }} €</strong></div>@foreach($calculationPreview['taxByRate'] as $rate=>$amount)<div class="total-line"><span>USt. {{ number_format((float)$rate,2,',','.') }} %</span><strong>{{ number_format($amount,2,',','.') }} €</strong></div>@endforeach<div class="total-line"><span>Steuer gesamt</span><strong>{{ number_format($calculationPreview['tax'],2,',','.') }} €</strong></div><div class="total-line grand"><span>Brutto</span><span>{{ number_format($calculationPreview['gross'],2,',','.') }} €</span></div></div>
